VOID K05 shared five-input / two-output physical resistor network, R06
* Exactly the physical resistive network from R04 K05, extracted only once.
* xp1 xm1 xp2 xm2 xp3: five separate analogue electrode connections.
* y0 and y1: open analogue sum ports. Meter loads are EXTERNAL connections.
* All R values are physically selectable discrete parts, nominal ohms.
.SUBCKT VOID_WEIGHTED_5X2 xp1 xm1 xp2 xm2 xp3 y0 y1
R01 xp1 y0 2000
R02 xm2 y0 4000
R03A xp3 y0 2000
R03B xp3 y0 4000
RG0 y0 0 2000
R11A xm1 y1 5000
R11B xm1 y1 10000
R12A xp2 y1 2500
R12B xp2 y1 5000
R13 xp3 y1 2500
RG1A y1 0 2000
RG1B y1 0 5000
.ENDS VOID_WEIGHTED_5X2
